<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centre Court schedule at the $7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles final (0230 GMT start)</p>
<p>4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>Men's doubles final</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge/Mark Woodforde (Australia) v 7-Sebastien Lareau (Canada)/Alex O'Brien (U.S.)</p>
</text>
